Slice #3 (weft new + weft list) is done and committed as `1fb2ffa`. Summary:

- `weft new [--feat FEAT-X]` scans `docs/prds/` for the highest existing `REQ-NNN`, allocates the next id, and writes a skeleton record (with a matching hash so `weft verify` accepts it) into `docs/prds/<feat>/` or `docs/prds/`.
- `weft list [--feat FEAT-X]` prints `id: description` (first line of `statement`) for each requirement, optionally filtered by `feat`.
